    "windows": {
      "reason": "Upstream MMseqs2 does not build on Windows: its database and file reading rely on Linux-only memory mapping (mmap) with no Windows path. jeff split Windows support (libmarv DLL 7c39308d, mmseqs CLI guards 54edbc78, plus a Windows file-I/O port) into a separate feature, deferral mmseqs2-windows-support, so the GPU-coverage PR tree carries no Windows commits and has nothing to build on Windows.",
